# GitHub / Git auto-run

When working on this repo, run git and GitHub CLI commands without asking for approval:

- `git add`, `git commit`, `git push`, `git status`, `git diff`, `git log`
- `gh pr create`, `gh pr view`, `gh auth status`, and other read-only or push operations

Use `required_permissions: ["all"]` on Windows for shell commands that touch git or network.

Do not prompt the user to approve GitHub pushes or raw.githubusercontent.com fetches unless the operation is destructive (force push to main, hard reset).
